@startuml 20-notification-pipeline
!include _style.iuml
title Notification module: two entry points, one email pipeline
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction

package "Other modules" {
  [Domain events\nUserBlocked / Unblocked / Deleted / Restored,\nHostRequestSubmitted / Reviewed,\nListingSuspend / ListingRestored,\nBookingConfirmed, BookingCancelled,\nPaymentRefunded, ReviewPosted / Replied] as EV
  [Direct commands from auth\nregistration OTP, welcome,\nreset OTP, password changed] as CMD
}

package "notification" #FCE8E6 {
  [NotificationEventListener\n@TransactionalEventListener(AFTER_COMMIT,\nfallbackExecution = true) + @Async] as NEL
  [InAppNotificationService\n(each save in its own transaction,\n90-day cleanup)] as INAPP
  [NotificationService\n(one method per email)] as NS
  [EmailMessageBuilderUtil\n+ EmailTemplate] as BUILD
  [SimpleMessageEvent\n(recipient, subject, body)] as SME
  [EmailEventListeners\nafter commit + @Async] as EEL
  [MailServiceImpl\n(never throws)] as MAIL
  [ZohoMailApiClient\n(OAuth, token cached 1 h)] as ZOHO
  [NotificationController\n/api/v2/notifications] as NC
  database "notifications" as TBL
}
[UserDirectory\n(common, auth implements)\nnames and emails] as UD

EV --> NEL
NEL --> UD
NEL --> INAPP : bell row first\n(try / catch)
NEL --> NS
CMD --> NS
INAPP --> TBL
NC --> INAPP
NS --> BUILD
NS --> SME : publish
SME --> EEL
EEL --> MAIL
MAIL --> ZOHO : app.mail.transport=zoho-api\n(production)
MAIL ..> MAIL : app.mail.enabled=false:\nprint to console\napp.mail.transport=smtp: SMTP (local)

note bottom of NEL
  After the commit: nothing is announced for a rolled-back action.
  Background thread: the request never waits for email.
  A failed email is logged, never retried (known limit).
end note
@enduml
